# palm_bent -- windswept shore palm, ~5.5m, hard lean toward +X, 6 fronds swept back toward -X
# trunk: 4 tapered cylinder segments, each rolled harder to bend the crown ~2m off centre
# The trunk is solid, measured at the base where the lean starts.
collide 0.30 4.0
